## 4. Canonical Reference Concepts (Domain-Mapped Idea Repository)

Reference these canonical concepts when applying the framework to specific technical domains (`Agentic AI`, `SRE/Observability`, `Chrome Extensions`, `Web-to-Mobile Architectures`):

### A. Agentic AI & Sovereign Compute
* **Sentinel-AI (Sovereign SRE Agent):** Air-gapped, local Agentic AI debugging tool running entirely inside enterprise VPC/firewall (`Lesson 1 - Compliance & Firewall Wedge`).
* **AgentGuardian (Safety & Reversibility Wrapper):** Deterministic pre-flight simulation and human-in-the-loop approval wrapper for autonomous web-action agents (`Lesson 10 - Control as a Moat`).
* **PlayTest Zero (Upstream Mechanics Oracle):** Pre-code predictive intelligence platform that scores raw gameplay/mechanic videos for viral retention before coding begins (`Lesson 3 - Upstream Strategy`).

### B. SRE, Observability & Developer Tools
* **ContextThread (Engineering Memory Graph):** Autonomous semantic graph linking codebase PRs to historical Slack debates and Jira decisions, surfaced via IDE/browser overlays (`Lesson 2 - Memory Graph`).
* **TraceWeave (Observability & Cost Sampling Firewall):** AI-driven OpenTelemetry proxy that drops verbose logs during normal traffic and switches to 100% trace capture during anomalies (`Lesson 7 - Prediction + Action Loop`).
* **CodeArmour (Codebase Provenance & Trust Layer):** Cryptographic attestation and audit pipeline proving human authorship vs. AI generation across enterprise repositories (`Lesson 9 - Trust Infrastructure`).

### C. Chrome Extensions & Web Overlays
* **HaggleLayer (E-Commerce Agentic Overlay):** Lightweight JS/Extension overlay that adds an autonomous, conversational haggling concierge to D2C product pages to close exit-intent shoppers (`Lesson 5 - Layer Over Surfaces`).
* **ExtensionForge (Conversational Ops Automation):** Conversational Chrome Extension generator that turns natural language ops requirements into custom, locally deployed Manifest V3 extensions (`Lesson 11 - Compress Execution Time`).

### D. Web-to-Mobile & Channel-Native Architectures
* **ChatERP (Channel-Native Business OS):** Full business ledger, invoicing, and inventory suite operating entirely within WhatsApp/Telegram voice notes and chats (`Lesson 14 - Channel-Native Distribution`).
* **PocketNode (Offline/Edge Field Operations Suite):** Offline-first React/Capacitor mobile suite powered by local Small Language Models (SLMs) and WebGPU for field defect reporting and data capture (`Lesson 12 - Verticalization`).
